      "title": "AWS Lambda Guide: Static Sites Without Servers",
      "slug": "aws-lambda-guide",
      "excerpt": "Serve a fast static website from S3 + CloudFront and use Lambda only where you truly need compute.",
      "content": "<h2>Why static first</h2><p>CloudFront serves cached HTML directly. No application server, no database round-trip.</p><h2>Where Lambda fits</h2><ul><li>Deployment callbacks</li><li>Contact forms</li><li>Preview auth</li></ul><p>Read the <a href=\"/about/\">about page</a> for context.</p>",
